# Fuzzing: the harness is committed, the corpora and crash artifacts are not
# (findings become regression fixtures + tests instead). The lockfile IS
# committed: lint:rust gates the harness on every push, and an unlocked
# resolve let a broken upstream release (zune-core 0.5.2) redden main
# minutes after it published.
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/target/

# go-task fingerprint cache
.task/

